# ---- R session artifacts ----
.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
.Renviron
Rplots.pdf

# ---- OS noise ----
.DS_Store

# ---- Trained model binaries ----
# 2.4 GB across 21 files; 18 of them exceed GitHub's 100 MB hard limit, so a
# push containing these is rejected outright. They are reproducible from
# train_and_save_ensemble.R and do not belong in version control.
models/
*.rds

# ---- Derived caches ----
# Rebuilt by the pipeline; large, churn every run, and carry no review value.
data/carryover_cache/
data/carryover_cache.pre-feature-additions/
data/elo_sweep_cache/

# ---- Data outputs ----
# This repo is PUBLIC. Everything under data/ stays local:
#   - private league rosters, standings and franchise records
#   - derived pipeline outputs (walk-forward evals, betting simulations,
#     tuning sweeps, upcoming bet cards) — all reproducible from the R sources
# data/game_w_features.csv is already tracked from earlier history and is left
# alone; ignoring a path does not untrack what git already follows.
/data/

# ---- Node ----
node_modules/
dist/
*.local
